  "review": {
    "official": "Formerly the personal bodyguard of Lady\nFumizuki\n, wife of\nLungmen's\nChief\nWei Yenwu\n, Shirayuki was sent to\nRhodes Island\nto serve the\nDoctor\nin the same role, after the\nLungmen Guard Department\npartnered with the company. She uses large shurikens as her weapons of choice, and is well-versed in covert ops and intelligence gathering. She protects the Doctor from behind the scenes.",
